-
-    ff: ff.Forcefield
-        Wrapper class around a list of handlers.
-
-    n_steps: int
-        Number of steps to run vacuum simulation for.
-
-    k: float
-        Harmonic bond K value
-
-    Returns
-    -------
-    tuple (mol_a_coords, mol_b_coords)
-        New coords of the two molecules.
-
-
-    """
-    mol_a_conf = get_romol_conf(mol_a)
